WEBVTT

00:00:21.660 --> 00:00:23.830
Waves are holding steady.

00:00:23.830 --> 00:00:28.170
The drugs have made
her nerves super sensitive.

00:00:28.170 --> 00:00:32.460
Still, no signs of inversion. Crank it up.

00:00:42.980 --> 00:00:44.600
Nightmare's attacking!

00:00:44.600 --> 00:00:47.020
Call for backup from Implement 2!

00:00:54.400 --> 00:01:00.490
I finally found you,
Second Spirit... "Sister."

00:02:41.260 --> 00:02:44.560
We're reading typical Spirit Wave levels.

00:02:44.560 --> 00:02:49.020
The path connecting you
and the Spirits has normalized.

00:02:49.020 --> 00:02:51.650
Really? That's a relief.

00:02:51.650 --> 00:02:56.480
You had me worried
with your rampage the other day,

00:02:56.480 --> 00:03:00.490
but I think it's safe
to resume regular checkups.

00:03:00.490 --> 00:03:03.570
Sorry for all the trouble.

00:03:03.570 --> 00:03:07.490
Though, I can't even
remember what happened.

00:03:11.670 --> 00:03:14.460
Shido! Is your checkup done?

00:03:14.460 --> 00:03:17.630
Hey, Tohka. Yeah, it went fine.

00:03:18.880 --> 00:03:20.590
That's wonderful!

00:03:20.590 --> 00:03:22.220
Thank goodness.

00:03:22.220 --> 00:03:28.560
Yoshino's been worried sick! She was
holding Natsumi's hand the whole time!

00:03:30.520 --> 00:03:34.650
I see. Sorry to trouble you, guys.

00:03:34.650 --> 00:03:39.230
Don't be. It's not like we did anything.

00:03:40.570 --> 00:03:42.860
Aren't your checkups next?

00:03:42.860 --> 00:03:46.910
I'll buy stuff for dinner
on the way home, so...

00:03:46.910 --> 00:03:48.580
Huh? Where's Kotori?

00:03:48.580 --> 00:03:53.210
Oh, she's busy with
something in Exam Room 2.

00:03:53.210 --> 00:03:55.460
Hurry and you might catch her.

00:03:55.460 --> 00:03:58.670
All right. See you guys later.

00:03:58.670 --> 00:04:00.880
--Okay!
--Yeah, yeah.

00:04:04.680 --> 00:04:07.220
Exam Room 2...

00:04:07.220 --> 00:04:09.560
It's this one, isn't it?

00:04:11.930 --> 00:04:16.230
Calm your butt down and let me strip you!

00:04:16.230 --> 00:04:19.150
K-Kotori?! Mana?!

00:04:19.150 --> 00:04:21.070
--Big brother!
--Shido!

00:04:21.070 --> 00:04:26.780
S-Sorry for intruding,
but it's wrong to force her into it!

00:04:26.780 --> 00:04:29.620
You've totally got the wrong idea.

00:04:29.620 --> 00:04:33.460
Kotori is forcing me to get a checkup!

00:04:33.460 --> 00:04:35.000
Huh?

00:04:35.000 --> 00:04:40.550
There's nothing wrong with me!
And why do I have to listen to you?

00:04:40.550 --> 00:04:46.930
I told you! You need an exam with all
the body enhancements DEM's done to you!

00:04:46.930 --> 00:04:49.260
My body's fine, thank you!

00:04:49.260 --> 00:04:54.890
But you keep stopping me from going
on missions! I wanna help out, too!

00:04:54.890 --> 00:04:59.940
Then let me exam you! I'll discover stuff
about your body you never knew!

00:04:59.940 --> 00:05:04.820
Big brother! Save me!

00:05:14.200 --> 00:05:15.580
"Happy New Year"

00:05:20.040 --> 00:05:25.090
Nobody has a clue there's
a huge secret base under all this.

00:05:29.350 --> 00:05:31.350
"Blast"
"Serial Publication"

00:05:34.600 --> 00:05:35.640
Huh?

00:05:38.810 --> 00:05:40.810
Whoa! What?!

00:05:43.320 --> 00:05:45.320
A-Are you okay?!

00:05:45.320 --> 00:05:47.030
Ar... ving.

00:05:47.030 --> 00:05:49.530
Huh? Wh-What was that?

00:05:49.530 --> 00:05:52.370
I'm... starving.

00:05:53.450 --> 00:05:54.830
Huh?

00:05:58.540 --> 00:06:00.460
Thanks, Boy.

00:06:00.460 --> 00:06:05.340
Of course. Say, do you want me
to take you to the hospital?

00:06:05.340 --> 00:06:09.680
Oh, heck no. It's not like I'm sick.

00:06:09.680 --> 00:06:14.350
By the way, can you talk less polite?
It feels so stiff.

00:06:14.350 --> 00:06:16.890
Oh... My apologies.

00:06:16.890 --> 00:06:21.560
There you go again. But anyway...

00:06:23.770 --> 00:06:30.030
I've been pushing 'em on you to show
my thanks, but you haven't reacted.

00:06:30.030 --> 00:06:31.700
Are you a butt guy?

00:06:33.080 --> 00:06:35.330
Wh-What are you talking about?!

00:06:35.330 --> 00:06:41.040
Or a big boob lover that thinks
anything under 80cm doesn't count?

00:06:41.040 --> 00:06:44.630
Sorry that my stack doesn't cut it.

00:06:44.630 --> 00:06:47.840
Can you not put me in weird groups?

00:06:47.840 --> 00:06:50.180
Oh. This building, please.

00:06:54.100 --> 00:06:55.100
Huh?

00:06:56.270 --> 00:06:59.140
Oof! Whew!

00:06:59.140 --> 00:07:01.400
Thanks, Boy.

00:07:05.650 --> 00:07:07.690
Are you a manga artist?

00:07:07.690 --> 00:07:13.120
You know it. Was working so hard,
I forgot to eat.

00:07:13.120 --> 00:07:19.290
I was heading to the store to buy food
when I found out how strong gravity is.

00:07:19.290 --> 00:07:21.370
Huh?!

00:07:21.370 --> 00:07:25.090
Is this what I think it is?!
<i>Silver Bullet?!</i>

00:07:25.090 --> 00:07:30.090
I'm surprised you knew.
Are you a reader? Thanks!

00:07:30.090 --> 00:07:35.680
Wait, hold up! That makes you
the author, Souji Honjo?!

00:07:35.680 --> 00:07:37.970
Yup, that's right.

00:07:37.970 --> 00:07:39.980
Y-You're not a guy?

00:07:39.980 --> 00:07:45.230
It's my pen name.
My real one's Nia. Nia Honjo.

00:07:45.230 --> 00:07:50.530
There's quite a few women using
guy pen names to write <i>shonen</i> manga.

00:07:50.530 --> 00:07:53.320
You know, like <i>Other Fake</i>'s Takajo.

00:07:53.320 --> 00:07:56.200
Wha--?! Hiroki Takajo, too?!

00:07:56.200 --> 00:07:58.660
Wait, it doesn't make sense!

00:07:58.660 --> 00:08:02.750
I mean, I read <i>Silver Bullet</i>
in elementary school.

00:08:02.750 --> 00:08:06.960
And the author stopped writing
for health reasons years ago.

00:08:06.960 --> 00:08:09.510
It's been ten years since my debut...

00:08:10.920 --> 00:08:15.590
I was out for a few reasons,
but I'm starting back up.

00:08:15.590 --> 00:08:19.140
Check out the next volume. It'll be there.

00:08:19.140 --> 00:08:24.730
Ten years ago?
But you don't even look 20 yet.

00:08:29.270 --> 00:08:31.440
B-Boy!

00:08:31.440 --> 00:08:34.820
Yeah, yeah. Lemme borrow your kitchen.

00:08:36.160 --> 00:08:42.290
Delicious! Delicious! What is this
culinary magic?! What is it?!

00:08:42.290 --> 00:08:47.210
What kind of life do you live?
All you have is beer in the fridge.

00:08:47.210 --> 00:08:51.550
Man! I haven't had a hot meal
like this in a week!

00:08:52.670 --> 00:08:57.590
I'll clean up and leave, so try not
to starve and collapse again.

00:08:57.590 --> 00:09:02.270
Now, now! Not so fast, Boy!
You wanna earn some money?

00:09:06.310 --> 00:09:08.270
What am I even doing?

00:09:08.270 --> 00:09:14.650
Sorry. I don't usually use assistants,
but the deadline is tight this time.

00:09:14.650 --> 00:09:17.910
It's fine, but what's the outfit for?

00:09:17.910 --> 00:09:22.830
For reference, but also as
special thanks for your service!

00:09:22.830 --> 00:09:26.250
Look! I've got no boobs,
but don't I got style?!

00:09:26.250 --> 00:09:28.540
Here. Is this good enough?

00:09:30.130 --> 00:09:32.630
Jeez! Trying to play cool?

00:09:32.630 --> 00:09:36.680
Whoa, you're not bad!
More of where that came from!

00:09:36.680 --> 00:09:38.300
Yeah, yeah.

00:09:40.260 --> 00:09:42.310
All done!

00:09:43.470 --> 00:09:46.190
I haven't focused that hard in ages!

00:09:46.190 --> 00:09:48.190
Thanks for all the help!

00:09:48.190 --> 00:09:50.360
Here! Come get your pay.

00:09:50.360 --> 00:09:52.650
Wh-What are you doing?!

00:09:52.650 --> 00:09:57.200
Don't be so fussy! C'mon, c'mon!

00:09:55.150 --> 00:09:56.400
"Pay"
"Boy"

00:10:03.490 --> 00:10:06.660
Is having small boobs a sin?!

00:10:06.660 --> 00:10:13.420
Um... I'm leaving for real, so keep
the money. It was a learning experience.

00:10:13.420 --> 00:10:17.470
Wait! Wait! That won't sit right with me!

00:10:17.470 --> 00:10:21.760
How about this? Next Saturday,
I'll go on a date with you!

00:10:21.760 --> 00:10:22.760
A date?

00:10:22.760 --> 00:10:28.480
In Akihabara! I haven't bought
much lately, so I wanna go!

00:10:28.480 --> 00:10:31.060
So I'm your bag carrier?

00:10:31.060 --> 00:10:32.400
Erk!

00:10:32.400 --> 00:10:36.610
Sorry, but ask someone else.
How about one of your friends?

00:10:40.070 --> 00:10:44.660
Gee, I don't really have
any friends! But still...

00:10:45.580 --> 00:10:47.910
Can you afford not to go?

00:10:47.910 --> 00:10:49.120
Huh?

00:10:50.830 --> 00:10:52.330
--There we go.
--Huh?

00:11:05.600 --> 00:11:11.980
Isn't it your job to make Spirits
fall for you, Shido Itsuka?

00:11:21.820 --> 00:11:24.660
It's been a month since Sister's escape...

00:11:24.660 --> 00:11:28.830
I can punish the facility crew
if you'd like.

00:11:28.830 --> 00:11:34.540
There's no need. Our talented
researchers are valuable. Besides...

00:11:34.540 --> 00:11:37.630
Besides... What, Ike?

00:11:38.840 --> 00:11:41.800
They couldn't have done a better job.

00:11:43.180 --> 00:11:46.760
What gives?!
Give a better reaction than that!

00:11:46.760 --> 00:11:49.980
--I just transformed for you!
--Huh?

00:11:49.980 --> 00:11:53.980
I was expecting a
"Wh-What the heck?!" at least!

00:11:53.980 --> 00:11:58.650
Or even better, "This girl's
transformation made my heart skip!"

00:11:58.650 --> 00:12:03.780
Look, look! My Spirit Armor
is sexy, don'tcha think?

00:12:03.780 --> 00:12:07.120
H-Hey! Quit teasing me!

00:12:07.120 --> 00:12:13.120
Nia, I get that you're a Spirit,
but how do you know about me?

00:12:13.120 --> 00:12:14.880
That I...

00:12:15.830 --> 00:12:19.250
That you date Spirits
and make them fall for you?

00:12:20.380 --> 00:12:23.260
Because... Raziel!

00:12:28.600 --> 00:12:34.520
This is my Angel, Raziel.
It can see everything in the world.

00:12:34.520 --> 00:12:36.480
In the world...?

00:12:36.480 --> 00:12:41.780
What's happening anywhere in the world...
What anyone is doing...

00:12:41.780 --> 00:12:46.200
For example,
how you just finished shopping

00:12:46.200 --> 00:12:49.660
and were on the way home.

00:12:49.660 --> 00:12:51.830
Huh? Then us meeting...?

00:12:51.830 --> 00:12:55.170
You really thought it was a coincidence?

00:12:55.170 --> 00:12:59.920
That some girl you found on the ground
turned out to be a Spirit?

00:12:59.920 --> 00:13:03.090
A story that bad I don't want any part of.

00:13:04.170 --> 00:13:08.430
So you purposely collapsed
knowing I'd help?

00:13:08.430 --> 00:13:09.350
Yup.

00:13:09.350 --> 00:13:12.600
And made me help with
your manga for a reason?

00:13:12.600 --> 00:13:14.980
Just to meet the deadline.

00:13:14.980 --> 00:13:16.230
You're kidding!

00:13:17.520 --> 00:13:20.480
So, what are you after?

00:13:20.480 --> 00:13:25.610
I'm not really after anything.
I just wanted to meet you.

00:13:25.610 --> 00:13:29.370
Until recently, I was DEM's captive.

00:13:29.370 --> 00:13:31.580
DEM? Westcott?!

00:13:31.580 --> 00:13:35.120
Yup. Hence "away" for five years.

00:13:35.120 --> 00:13:40.460
But I finally got a chance to escape,
and now I can get back to work!

00:13:40.460 --> 00:13:43.010
Five years with DEM...

00:13:43.010 --> 00:13:47.050
But while I was captive...
Ratatoskr, was it?

00:13:47.050 --> 00:13:51.220
A secret organization
started looking for Spirits.

00:13:51.220 --> 00:13:56.480
Um... So with your Raziel,
you know everything about me?

00:13:57.650 --> 00:14:03.610
Not everything. Even Raziel
can't read the future or people's hearts.

00:14:03.610 --> 00:14:06.200
But it <i>can</i> do this...

00:14:10.700 --> 00:14:12.490
Huh?!

00:14:12.490 --> 00:14:15.450
My body's moving on its own!

00:14:19.080 --> 00:14:21.750
Eek!

00:14:21.750 --> 00:14:24.840
Hold up! What was that all about?!

00:14:24.840 --> 00:14:29.470
"Future Entry."
Everything written in Raziel is true--

00:14:29.470 --> 00:14:33.060
Even if it's something added to it.

00:14:33.060 --> 00:14:34.930
Future Entry?

00:14:34.930 --> 00:14:39.770
Yup! The things written in
Raziel become true.

00:14:39.770 --> 00:14:44.530
Having said that, it can be a pain
to write everything out.

00:14:44.530 --> 00:14:48.610
I-I see. That does seem inconvenient.

00:14:48.610 --> 00:14:53.660
Boy, you're not seeing
how terrifying Raziel can be.

00:14:53.660 --> 00:14:58.210
Say, Boy... You seem to know
your way around a manga.

00:14:58.210 --> 00:15:02.130
You've tried to
draw one before, haven't you?

00:15:02.130 --> 00:15:06.920
I wonder what kind of manga it was?
Let's ask Mr. Raziel!

00:15:06.920 --> 00:15:08.420
Let's see...

00:15:09.590 --> 00:15:12.050
Ooh! The Black Knight, Lievan!

00:15:12.890 --> 00:15:16.390
Uh, this girl needs some work.

00:15:15.850 --> 00:15:20.310
"Flashing Thunder Wave!"

00:15:16.390 --> 00:15:18.430
What a cool attack!

00:15:18.430 --> 00:15:20.730
Flashing Thunder Wave!

00:15:20.730 --> 00:15:26.940
All your original characters from
middle school! Talk about embarrassing!

00:15:26.940 --> 00:15:28.990
S-Stop!

00:15:28.990 --> 00:15:32.660
Well? See how terrifying Raziel can be?

00:15:32.660 --> 00:15:37.080
Yes, it's incredible!
Sorry for doubting it.

00:15:37.080 --> 00:15:41.580
Seeing how you helped with the manga
and your rice soup was tasty,

00:15:41.580 --> 00:15:44.790
I thought I'd give you a chance.

00:15:44.790 --> 00:15:45.790
A chance?

00:15:45.790 --> 00:15:49.590
To make me fall for you with a date.

00:15:49.590 --> 00:15:53.470
If you think you can win me over,
win me over.

00:15:53.470 --> 00:15:56.810
I'm looking forward to next Saturday, Boy!

00:16:04.310 --> 00:16:10.400
Akiba! I'm home!
Home...! Home...! Home...!

00:16:10.400 --> 00:16:13.240
How to put this...
You're really decked out.

00:16:14.200 --> 00:16:15.070
"Tokiya"

00:16:16.740 --> 00:16:18.410
Shido, you copy?

00:16:18.410 --> 00:16:20.040
Yeah, I hear you.

00:16:20.040 --> 00:16:25.960
She doesn't seem hostile from
what you've said, but be on your guard.

00:16:25.960 --> 00:16:31.670
Got it. Let's raise her happiness today
before DEM finds her.

00:16:31.670 --> 00:16:35.220
Guys, sorry about the makeshift
command room,

00:16:35.220 --> 00:16:38.390
but bear with it
until Fraxinus is repaired.

00:16:38.390 --> 00:16:39.430
--Roger!
--Roger!

00:16:39.430 --> 00:16:42.810
Now then, shall we begin our date?

00:16:43.440 --> 00:16:46.650
"1. Cute clothes. They look good on you."
"2. What ugly clothes. I'll buy you something new."
"3. Oh? Those clothes will be fun to take off later."

00:16:44.650 --> 00:16:46.730
Commander, we have choices!

00:16:46.730 --> 00:16:48.190
Make your choice!

00:16:50.070 --> 00:16:51.900
"1. Cute clothes. They look good on you."
"2. What ugly clothes. I'll buy you something new."
"3. Oh? Those clothes will be fun to take off later."

00:16:52.110 --> 00:16:58.160
Oh? That's surprising.
The safest choice came in third.

00:16:56.160 --> 00:16:57.910
"1. Cute clothes. They look good on you."

00:16:58.160 --> 00:17:04.040
'Cuz, well... How to say it?
Nia's clothes are kinda..."

00:17:04.040 --> 00:17:08.750
True. Complimenting that
get-up sounds like sarcasm.

00:17:08.750 --> 00:17:11.670
Then, wouldn't two be best?

00:17:11.670 --> 00:17:15.380
A harsh comment followed
by a glimpse of kindness!

00:17:15.380 --> 00:17:19.510
Picking out her clothes is the way to go!

00:17:19.510 --> 00:17:26.100
No, think about it.
Nia didn't come today to buy clothes.

00:17:26.100 --> 00:17:29.570
Manga, light novels, figures, Blu-rays!
That's her goal!

00:17:29.570 --> 00:17:34.490
Forcing her to shop for clothes
would be nothing short of torture!

00:17:34.490 --> 00:17:38.780
Ooh! That's Nakatsugawa,
"The Man With 100 Wives," for you!

00:17:38.780 --> 00:17:42.040
Your knowledge of love
transcends dimensions!

00:17:43.040 --> 00:17:48.710
And according to Shido, she makes
naughty comments all the time.

00:17:48.710 --> 00:17:51.840
Making a dirty joke might bring them closer.

00:17:53.800 --> 00:17:55.670
Shido, try three.

00:17:55.670 --> 00:17:59.090
What's up? Why so quiet, Boy?

00:17:59.090 --> 00:18:02.970
Uh, no... Um, well...

00:18:02.970 --> 00:18:09.360
O-Oh? Those clothes
will be fun to take off later.

00:18:09.360 --> 00:18:10.400
Huh?

00:18:10.400 --> 00:18:12.320
Uh, I...

00:18:15.740 --> 00:18:21.370
You wanna take it all the way today?
I didn't think you were such a player!

00:18:21.370 --> 00:18:23.700
Th-That's not what I--

00:18:23.700 --> 00:18:29.920
You've gotta go that far to seal Spirit power?
Then lemme change my panties.

00:18:29.920 --> 00:18:32.590
--Eh?!
--I'm kidding! I'm kidding!

00:18:33.880 --> 00:18:37.680
You're getting advice from Ratatoskr, right?

00:18:40.140 --> 00:18:45.600
Yay! Yay! Are you watching this, Kotori?!

00:18:45.600 --> 00:18:48.600
I sure am. Very closely.

00:18:54.230 --> 00:18:59.320
Thanks for carrying my stuff, Boy.
What a gentleman!

00:18:59.320 --> 00:19:01.280
It's no big deal.

00:19:01.280 --> 00:19:02.620
Yoink.

00:19:02.620 --> 00:19:04.740
She's making all the moves, Shido!

00:19:04.740 --> 00:19:06.330
I dunno what to say.

00:19:06.330 --> 00:19:08.750
Ooh! Target spotted!

00:19:08.750 --> 00:19:10.620
Let's go!

00:19:13.130 --> 00:19:17.840
I haven't been here in so long,
it all feels so new!

00:19:17.840 --> 00:19:21.010
Can't you keep up to date with Raziel?

00:19:21.010 --> 00:19:26.680
I try to refrain from using Raziel
when it's not necessary--

00:19:26.680 --> 00:19:28.980
'cuz I hate spoilers.

00:19:30.350 --> 00:19:35.150
Did DEM make you use it
while you were captured?

00:19:35.150 --> 00:19:38.030
Hmm? I don't really remember.

00:19:38.030 --> 00:19:40.570
Huh? The whole five years?

00:19:40.570 --> 00:19:44.780
They always kept tampering
with my mind and stuff.

00:19:44.780 --> 00:19:50.910
But if they had such a hard time,
I doubt they were able to use it.

00:19:51.750 --> 00:19:55.960
You never used Raziel
to see what happened to you?

00:19:55.960 --> 00:20:01.090
Nah, I'd rather not.
I know it won't be pretty anyway.

00:20:01.090 --> 00:20:05.600
"Chronicle
Kitan Tokiya"

00:20:03.260 --> 00:20:06.140
Look at all the Tokiya goods!

00:20:06.140 --> 00:20:07.970
You like him that much?

00:20:07.970 --> 00:20:14.100
"Like" doesn't even begin to describe it!
He's the reason I got into manga!

00:20:14.100 --> 00:20:17.440
Tokiya is my wife! A guy, but my wife!

00:20:17.570 --> 00:20:20.990
"A Boy's Club for Two"
"Hands, Hearts, Together"

00:20:18.440 --> 00:20:21.150
Uh, you like this stuff, too?

00:20:21.150 --> 00:20:24.870
Hmph! Those without a
Maiden Circuit wouldn't understand.

00:20:24.870 --> 00:20:26.990
Is that even a saying?

00:20:26.990 --> 00:20:33.040
Pros in this field can perceive
anyone's nature in a single glance!

00:20:33.960 --> 00:20:35.540
Timid bottom.

00:20:35.540 --> 00:20:38.420
Hey! How did you classify me?!

00:20:39.420 --> 00:20:45.050
The mood looks good. We haven't had
a date go this smooth in a while.

00:20:45.050 --> 00:20:48.430
Yeah. It's about time for the next step.

00:20:51.850 --> 00:20:55.020
Well, that was fun! I'm satisfied!

00:20:55.020 --> 00:20:57.400
Yeah, I had a good time, too.

00:21:00.820 --> 00:21:04.660
Let's swing by a café.
This way's a shortcut.

00:21:08.660 --> 00:21:09.910
Nia!

00:21:20.500 --> 00:21:22.010
Now's your chance, Shido!

00:21:23.130 --> 00:21:25.300
N-Nia...

00:21:28.220 --> 00:21:29.680
I...

00:21:32.180 --> 00:21:33.520
Sorry.

00:21:35.480 --> 00:21:36.980
It's no use.

00:21:36.980 --> 00:21:38.270
Huh?

00:21:38.270 --> 00:21:42.280
I don't wanna be chased by DEM,

00:21:42.280 --> 00:21:45.860
so I really wouldn't mind if you sealed me...

00:21:48.370 --> 00:21:52.700
But the truth is, I can only love 2D.

00:21:52.700 --> 00:21:54.960
"Episode 01:
'Don't Panic. It's a Spirit's Trap.'"

00:21:53.540 --> 00:21:54.960
Huh?

00:23:25.840 --> 00:23:31.340
The opening narration can do
the episode preview. Now that's freedom.

00:23:31.340 --> 00:23:33.930
Shido's dates are again underway!

00:23:33.930 --> 00:23:37.180
Next time: "So Be It! 2D It Is!"

00:23:35.810 --> 00:23:41.500
"Episode 02:
'So Be It! 2D It is!'"

00:23:37.180 --> 00:23:41.450
<i>Date A Live</i>'s fourth act has begun!
